digital-signage-toolkit (2.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release of Digital Signage Toolkit GUI application
  * Complete rewrite from Bash script to Python/PyQt6
  * Features:
    - Master Setup for new kiosks
    - Audit & Fix for maintenance
    - OS Upgrade with automatic snapshots
    - Watchdog Management
    - Full System Restore using Timeshift
    - Hardware Monitoring
  * Proper Debian package with system-wide installation

